 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Dropped from Tote bag: Tumi ranges Alpha, Alpha Bravo, Harrison, Voyageur and the Voyageur Just-in-Case Tote (brief: Tumi ranges belong in Tumi's brand entry). Old flat models Kinchaku and Reticule became maker-free archetypes; Rockstud (maker given as Valentino Garavani, now brand-register name Valentino) became an archetype; Andiamo and Park became archetypes; Paloma, Hana, Lotus stay in m. Not added (no retrievable source this session): The Row Park Tote launch year; Saint Louis launch year; Noé BB/Petit Noé years; Le Pliage Néo/Cuir variants; Boat and Tote 1965 relaunch (llbean.com blocked); Mansur Gavriel founding year/country (Wikipedia page missing). Dior official and PurseBlog pages returned 403; Le Pliage and Mansur Gavriel Wikipedia articles do not exist. No traditions added (kinchaku tradition page not retrieved)."
}